WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.880
Have you ever wondered what SCP-805,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.000
the horse made of branches, wants&nbsp;
more than anything in the world?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.920
Foundation scientists used SCP-978,&nbsp;
the Desire Camera, to snap a picture&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.720
of SCP-805 while it was frolicking in&nbsp;
its paddock, and this was the result:

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.580
"Being patted and hugged by smiling&nbsp;
humans, one of whom is astride its back."

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.880
All the creature wants is&nbsp;
to be loved, appreciated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:26.220
and treated like any over prized horse.

